  "body": "### Finding Description and Impact\n\nThe `increaseStake` and `decreaseStake` functions in the Distributor contract send reward tokens to the Launchpad contract (`msg.sender`) instead of the intended user address. This occurs in the `_distributeAssets` function, which uses `msg.sender` (Launchpad) as the recipient rather than the user's address.\n\n**Root Cause:**\nThe issue is in the `Distributor._distributeAssets` function, which is called by both `increaseStake` and `decreaseStake`:\n\n```solidity\nfunction _distributeAssets(address base, uint256 baseAmount, address quote, uint256 quoteAmount) internal {\n    if (baseAmount > 0) {\n        _decreaseTotalPending(base, baseAmount);\n        base.safeTransfer(msg.sender, baseAmount); // ❌ Goes to Launchpad\n    }\n\n    if (quoteAmount > 0) {\n        _decreaseTotalPending(quote, quoteAmount);\n        quote.safeTransfer(msg.sender, quoteAmount); // ❌ Goes to Launchpad\n    }\n}\n```\n\nWhen `increaseStake` or `decreaseStake` are called:\n\n```solidity\nfunction increaseStake(address launchAsset, address account, uint96 shares)\n    external\n    onlyLaunchpad  // msg.sender = Launchpad\n    returns (uint256 baseAmount, uint256 quoteAmount)\n{\n    RewardPoolData storage rs = RewardsTrackerStorage.getRewardPool(launchAsset);\n    \n    (baseAmount, quoteAmount) = rs.stake(account, uint96(shares)); // Rewards calculated for account\n    _distributeAssets(launchAsset, baseAmount, rs.quoteAsset, quoteAmount); // But sent to msg.sender (Launchpad)\n}\n```\n\nThe Launchpad contract has no mechanism to forward these rewards to users, resulting in permanently locked rewards.\n\n**Impact:**\n1. **Rewards Locked**: Earned reward tokens become permanently trapped in the Launchpad contract\n2. **Direct Financial Loss**: This affects all users who stake tokens during bonding\n\n### Recommended Mitigation\n\nModify the `_distributeAssets` function to accept a recipient parameter and update the stake functions to pass the correct user address.\n\n**Step 1: Create a new function that accepts recipient parameter**\n```solidity\nfunction _distributeAssetsTo(\n    address recipient,\n    address base, \n    uint256 baseAmount, \n    address quote, \n    uint256 quoteAmount\n) internal {\n    if (baseAmount > 0) {\n        _decreaseTotalPending(base, baseAmount);\n        base.safeTransfer(recipient, baseAmount); // ✅ Send to intended recipient\n    }\n\n    if (quoteAmount > 0) {\n        _decreaseTotalPending(quote, quoteAmount);\n        quote.safeTransfer(recipient, quoteAmount); // ✅ Send to intended recipient\n    }\n}\n```\n\n**Step 2: Update the stake functions to use the new function**\n```solidity\nfunction increaseStake(address launchAsset, address account, uint96 shares)\n    external\n    onlyLaunchpad\n    returns (uint256 baseAmount, uint256 quoteAmount)\n{\n    RewardPoolData storage rs = RewardsTrackerStorage.getRewardPool(launchAsset);\n    \n    (baseAmount, quoteAmount) = rs.stake(account, uint96(shares));\n    _distributeAssetsTo(account, launchAsset, baseAmount, rs.quoteAsset, quoteAmount); // ✅ Send to user\n}\n\nfunction decreaseStake(address launchAsset, address account, uint96 shares)\n    external\n    onlyLaunchpad\n    returns (uint256 baseAmount, uint256 quoteAmount)\n{\n    RewardPoolData storage rs = RewardsTrackerStorage.getRewardPool(launchAsset);\n    \n    (baseAmount, quoteAmount) = rs.unstake(account, uint96(shares));\n    _distributeAssetsTo(account, launchAsset, baseAmount, rs.quoteAsset, quoteAmount); // ✅ Send to user\n}\n```\n\n**Step 3: Keep the original function for claimRewards (which works correctly)**",
  "proof_of_concept": "```solidity\n    function test_VerifyRewardDestinationOnIncreaseStake() public {\n        vm.prank(launchpad);\n        d.createRewardsPair(baseToken, quoteToken);\n\n        baseToken.safeApprove(address(d), 100 ether);\n        quoteToken.safeApprove(address(d), 100 ether);\n\n        vm.prank(launchpad);\n        d.increaseStake(baseToken, userA, 1);\n\n        d.addRewards(baseToken, quoteToken, 10  ether, 0);\n\n        uint256 distributorBalanceBefore = baseToken.balanceOf(address(d));\n        uint256 userABalanceBefore = baseToken.balanceOf(userA);\n        uint256 launchpadBalanceBefore = baseToken.balanceOf(launchpad);\n\n        console.log(\"=== BEFORE increaseStake ===\");\n        console.log(\"Distributor balance:\", distributorBalanceBefore);\n        console.log(\"UserA balance:\", userABalanceBefore);\n        console.log(\"Launchpad balance:\", launchpadBalanceBefore);\n\n        (uint256 pendingBase, uint256 pendingQuote) = d.getPendingRewards(baseToken, userA);\n        console.log(\"UserA pending rewards:\", pendingBase);\n\n        vm.prank(launchpad);\n        d.increaseStake(baseToken, userA, 5);\n\n        uint256 distributorBalanceAfter = baseToken.balanceOf(address(d));\n        uint256 userABalanceAfter = baseToken.balanceOf(userA);\n        uint256 launchpadBalanceAfter = baseToken.balanceOf(launchpad);\n\n        console.log(\"=== AFTER increaseStake ===\");\n        console.log(\"Distributor balance:\", distributorBalanceAfter);\n        console.log(\"UserA balance:\", userABalanceAfter);\n        console.log(\"Launchpad balance:\", launchpadBalanceAfter);\n\n        (uint256 pendingBaseAfter, uint256 pendingQuoteAfter) = d.getPendingRewards(baseToken, userA);\n        console.log(\"UserA pending rewards after:\", pendingBaseAfter);\n\n        uint256 distributorDecrease = distributorBalanceBefore - distributorBalanceAfter;\n        uint256 launchpadIncrease = launchpadBalanceAfter - launchpadBalanceBefore;\n        uint256 userABalanceChange = userABalanceAfter - userABalanceBefore;            \n\n        console.log(\"=== BALANCE CHANGES ===\");\n        console.log(\"Distributor balance decrease:\", distributorDecrease);\n        console.log(\"UserA balance change:\", userABalanceChange);\n        console.log(\"Launchpad balance increase:\", launchpadIncrease);\n\n        assertEq(userABalanceChange, 0, \"UserA should NOT receive rewards from increaseStake\");\n        assertGt(distributorDecrease, 0, \"Distributor should decrease by pending rewards\");\n        assertGt(launchpadIncrease, 0, \"Launchpad should receive rewards from increaseStake\");\n\n        assertEq(pendingBaseAfter, 0, \"Pending rewards should be 0 after increaseStake\");\n        assertEq(distributorDecrease, pendingBase, \"Distributor should decrease by exactly the pending rewards\");\n        assertEq(launchpadIncrease, pendingBase, \"Launchpad should receive exactly the pending rewards\");\n\n        console.log(\"VERIFICATION COMPLETE: Rewards go to Launchpad contract!\");\n    }\n```\nadd the test to `distributor.t.sol`",
